# CODEOWNERS
# Each line is a file pattern followed by one or more owners.
# Order matters — the last matching pattern takes precedence.
# https://docs.github.com/en/repositories/managing-your-repositorys-settings-and-features/customizing-your-repository/about-code-owners

# Default — require review from a core maintainer for everything
*                           @indoulia

# Docs — any contributor can approve
docs/                       @indoulia
templates/                  @indoulia

# Security-sensitive paths — require security team review
SECURITY.md                 @indoulia
src/**/Security/            @indoulia
src/**/Auth/                @indoulia
src/**/Cryptography/        @indoulia

# CI / build infrastructure
.github/                    @indoulia
scripts/                    @indoulia
Directory.Build.props        @indoulia
